# Recordings. Excluded on purpose, for two reasons:
#   1. They are recordings of a person's chest — biometric data. This repo is
#      public. Do not publish them without deciding to, deliberately.
#   2. They are large (a 30 s raw capture is ~1.9 MB) and fully regenerable by
#      re-running the recorder.
# To publish a specific one anyway:  git add -f chest01.png
*.wav
*.png

